B.bhB=new A.w("Max Draft = MAX(Fore Draft, Aft Draft)\nMean Draft = (Fore Draft + Aft Draft) / 2\nCb = (Displacement / Water Density) / (LBP \xd7 Breadth \xd7 Mean Draft), or entered from vessel tables.\nSafety Margin = 10% \xd7 Max Draft\nSquat = Cb \xd7 STW\xb2 / 50\nHeel Correction = 0.008 \xd7 Breadth \xd7 |Heel Angle in degrees|\nDensity Correction = manually entered value, initially 0 m.\nENC ZOC: A1 = 0.5 + 0.01d; A2/B = 1 + 0.02d; C = 2 + 0.05d.\nD/U require a justified manual depth allowance and its basis. Without these, assessment is incomplete.\n\nSafety Depth is the sum of Max Draft, Safety Margin, Squat, Heel Correction, Density Correction and ENC ZOC Correction.\nd is the entered charted depth. Result is rounded upward to 0.01 m.\n\nThe configured squat and linear heel relations are approximations. Use them within the conditions applicable to the vessel. Mean fore/aft draught is a simple approximation. CATZOC depth accuracy is a 95% measure, not a guaranteed seabed limit. Do not add a density correction already included in the entered draughts. This calculation does not select an ECDIS contour or assess passage safety.",null,B.RU,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
